    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "17f3bbc1599a1846",
      "translationZh": "Grok Build 插件市场",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d631e340c8303da",
      "translationZh": "推出 Grok Build 内置插件市场。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23b351b83df55419",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们正式推出 Grok Build 插件市场，为 Grok Build 带来一系列内置插件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bad46a81b70f90b",
      "translationZh": "插件将技能、斜杠命令、智能体、钩子、MCP 服务器和 LSP 打包成一个可安装的软件包。插件市场内置于 Grok Build，因此你无需离开终端，即可浏览、安装和更新插件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2c55f867ed39b5c",
      "translationZh": "插件市场首发提供来自技术栈各层合作伙伴的插件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b5adb33e61334384",
      "translationZh": "MongoDB — 探索数据、管理集合并优化查询。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eb7bcf5af8b67375",
      "translationZh": "Vercel — 管理部署、检查构建状态并配置域名。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "61cd494a7e8ee827",
      "translationZh": "Sentry — 分析堆栈跟踪并调试生产环境中的错误。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6170d267d2323770",
      "translationZh": "Chrome DevTools — 控制实时运行的浏览器、记录性能跟踪数据并检查网络请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c910eed180451ebc",
      "translationZh": "Cloudflare — 适用于 Workers、Durable Objects 等的技能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "35bcecfe17d99c11",
      "translationZh": "Superpowers — 广受欢迎的智能体驱动工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90db9ed4611d5920",
      "translationZh": "在 Grok Build 中，输入 /marketplace 浏览目录，然后按 i 安装插件。也可以通过终端操作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "feb0fb4c9884aef0",
      "translationZh": "目录中的每个远程插件都固定到一个特定的提交 SHA，Grok Build 会在安装时验证这一固定引用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00b4d089cdcbe740",
      "translationZh": "该市场是一个开放目录。如果你构建了想要分享的插件，请向 xai-org/plugin-marketplace 提交拉取请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70157210c3dcca6c",
      "translationZh": "初次使用 Grok Build？访问 x.ai/build 即可开始。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
